* TI ADC dynamic spectrum reference netlist (ngspice).
*
* Rendered parameterized netlists are written to
*   <output-dir>/logs/netlists/ti_dynamic_spectrum.cir
* when using:
*
*   python scripts/run_ti_dynamic.py --ngspice --output-dir outputs/ngspice/ideal
*
* Python mux post-process applies mismatch-aware quantization on the muxed stream.

* See src/ti_adc/ngspice_engine.py::render_ti_dynamic_netlist
